THIRD-PARTY DATA AND ATTRIBUTION

The code in this repository is MIT licensed. Generated datasets in
`data/processed/` are derived from FLOATBench and therefore inherit CC-BY-4.0.

FLOATBench
  Ribeiro, J. A., Ribeiro, B. A., Pimenta, F., Tavares, S. M. O., Ahmed, F.
  "FLOATBench: A Dataset and Benchmark for Floating Offshore Wind Turbine
  Tower Fatigue", arXiv:2605.25717.
  Dataset: https://huggingface.co/datasets/DeCoDELab/FLOATBench  (CC-BY-4.0)
  Code:    https://github.com/Joao97ribeiro/FLOATBench            (MIT)

IEA-22-280-RWT reference wind turbine
  Zahle, F. et al. "Definition of the IEA Wind 22-Megawatt Offshore Reference
  Wind Turbine", IEA Wind Task 55 REFWIND.
  https://github.com/IEAWindSystems/IEA-22-280-RWT                (Apache-2.0)
  Files used: windIO properties, OpenFAST steady-state operating points,
  Cp/Ct/Cq rotor performance tables, and the semi-submersible ROSCO
  DISCON.IN actuator limits.

OpenFAST
  https://github.com/OpenFAST/openfast                            (Apache-2.0)

ROSCO
  https://github.com/NREL/ROSCO                                   (Apache-2.0)
